{"id":"7a9a6ec6fb6ca2f8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_IPCModel.md","title":"IPCModel","display":"IPCModel","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"IPCModel","parameters":["w","r","v","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"IPCModel"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ IPCModel w r v b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nonempty w)\n  (and\n    (@ RelationOn w r)\n    (and\n      (@ Reflexive w r)\n      (and\n        (@ Transitive w r)\n        (and\n          (@ WorldVal w v)\n          (and (forall n (forall u (implies (@ App v n u) (@ Upset w r u)))) (and (@ Upset w r b) (@ Empty b))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"31def2a0ecebb8cf\" href=\"?note=31def2a0ecebb8cf\" title=\"ZFC_Reflexive\">Reflexive</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" href=\"?note=cdb56d21d1bffdf8\" title=\"ZFC_RelationOn\">RelationOn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2b88fdcc29f28660\" href=\"?note=2b88fdcc29f28660\" title=\"ZFC_Transitive\">Transitive</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc695eb227b0fc76\" href=\"?note=fc695eb227b0fc76\" title=\"ZFC_Upset\">Upset</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"beeed89974e85c6b\" href=\"?note=beeed89974e85c6b\" title=\"ZFC_WorldVal\">WorldVal</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ IPCModel w r v b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Empty","status":"resolved","id":"b6471a8f381739eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nonempty","status":"resolved","id":"fe68ff8d3284eeda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|